msgid "<IBMVideo id=\"134397390\" title=\"In this video, Olivia Lanes describes how a problem is mapped onto a quantum computer. In particular, she explains that a qubit may represent a node in a graph, a step of a protein backbone along a discretized lattice, and more.\"/>\n"
